  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2017-07-28",
   "text": "This bill prohibits federal agencies and nonprofit entities that conduct federally funded health care research from providing a patent for a drug based on such research until the entity receiving the patent enters into a reasonable pricing agreement with the Department of Health and Human Services."
  }
